{"id":"sapphire","name":"Sapphire","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:sapphire"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Sapphire","text":"Associated with diamonds (Ex. 28:18) and emeralds (Ezek. 28:13); one of the stones in the high priest’s breastplate. It is a precious stone of a sky-blue colour, probably the lapis lazuli, brought from Babylon. The throne of God is described as of the colour of a sapphire (Ex. 24:10; comp. Ezek. 1:26)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H5601","lemma":"סַפִּיר","xlit":"çappîyr","gloss":"a gem , probably the sapphire","kjv":"sapphire","count":6,"share":0.86},{"strong":"H68","lemma":"אֶבֶן","xlit":"ʼeben","gloss":"a stone","kjv":"carbuncle, mason, plummet, stone","count":4,"share":0.57},{"strong":"H3095","lemma":"יַהֲלֹם","xlit":"yahălôm","gloss":"a precious stone, probably onyx","kjv":"diamond","count":2,"share":0.29},{"strong":"H5306","lemma":"נֹפֶךְ","xlit":"nôphek","gloss":"shining","kjv":"emerald","count":2,"share":0.29},{"strong":"H7718","lemma":"שֹׁהַם","xlit":"shôham","gloss":"a gem, probably the beryl","kjv":"onyx","count":2,"share":0.29},{"strong":"H3368","lemma":"יָקָר","xlit":"yâqâr","gloss":"valuable","kjv":"brightness, clear, costly, excellent","count":2,"share":0.29}],"verses":["Exod.28.18","Job.28.6","Job.28.16","Isa.54.11","Ezek.1.26","Ezek.28.13","Rev.21.19"],"related":[{"id":"emerald","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.333,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"precious-stones","type":"cooccur","shared":7,"jaccard":0.109,"why":"7 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"stones","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.027,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"honesty","type":"lexical","strong":"H68","why":"both lead with אֶבֶן (H68)"},{"id":"lamentations","type":"lexical","strong":"H68","why":"both lead with אֶבֶן (H68)"},{"id":"onyx","type":"lexical","strong":"H68","why":"both lead with אֶבֶן (H68)"},{"id":"pillar","type":"lexical","strong":"H68","why":"both lead with א